The CarlaBEV maintainer confirmed that the images and graph files in this
directory were created by the maintainer and derived from CARLA. Local changes
include exported/processed BEV RGB and semantic raster maps, multiple raster
resolutions, extracted route graphs, and the canonical directed vehicle graph.
These changes do not imply endorsement by the CARLA Team.

